<h1>XSPF Home</h1>

<p>XSPF is the XML format for sharing playlists.</p>
<ul>
<li>It is <em>portable</em>. You should be able to carry a playlist from one place to another.</li>
<li>It is <em>well-engineered</em>. Most playlist formats have bugs that make life harder for programmers and users.</li>
<li>It is <em>free</em> (as in liberty) and <em>open</em>. No proprietary lock-in.</li>
</ul>

<p>Need JSON instead of XML? Use <a href="/jspf">JSPF</a>, the JSON Shareable Playlist Format.</p>


